b_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329520/extras/0c870e758d86b98f21b8dba39ad09887.poster.avif?t=1755163820\" width=800 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329520/extras/0c870e758d86b98f21b8dba39ad09887.webm?t=1755163820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329520/extras/0c870e758d86b98f21b8dba39ad09887.mp4?t=1755163820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So go ahead, intrepid souls! In Labyrintheam, you don\u2019t get out alone, no, no! Here, collaboration is key, or you\u2019ll end up as tavern decorations. Remember, the door only opens when two heads think together.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329520/extras/08746a96364fadb432eda0d2b98821ef.poster.avif?t=1755163820\" width=800 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329520/extras/08746a96364fadb432eda0d2b98821ef.webm?t=1755163820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329520/extras/08746a96364fadb432eda0d2b98821ef.mp4?t=1755163820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, strangers! And may the winds of fortune always blow in your favor!</p>",
